  "summary": "Redwood City police arrested a 52-year-old man in connection with a fatal hit-and-run after using surveillance video and Automated License Plate Reader data to identify the suspect vehicle, a white Toyota Tundra. The ALPR search returned a single matching vehicle linked to a local address, leading to the suspect's arrest.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Investigators determined the vehicle was a late-model white Toyota Tundra and used data from their Automated License Plate Reader, or ALPR, to search for matching vehicles in the area at the time of the crash.",
      "paragraph_idx": 6
    },
    {
      "quote": "According to police, the search identified a single vehicle linked to a local address.",
      "paragraph_idx": 7
    }
